      "defense_target_type": "def",
      "description": "<p>You briefly connect the threads of life between two creatures, allowing one to transfer a portion of their vitality to the other. Either target may <strong>spend up to 50 Hit Points</strong>. The other creature recovers an equal amount of Hit Points.</p>\n<p><strong>Additionally,</strong> until this spell ends, the creature who recovered Hit Points this way gains a <strong>+2 bonus</strong> to Checks using <strong>MIG</strong> that aren’t Accuracy Checks or Magic Checks.</p>\n",
